{"id": "36945", "title": "叛逃者", "author": "黑天魔神", "category": "科幻小说", "count": 20, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/36/36945/36945s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/36/36945.htm", "intro": "一个生活在社会最底层的平民少年，无意中得到了聚集人类所有智慧的金属头骨。在武技和精神能力得到大幅提升的同时，他更以超低价格大量回收制造低等舰船。利用自己掌握的“奇迹”，把小炮艇改造成巡洋舰，把护卫艇改造成战列舰，把小飞机合并重构成宇宙母舰。从此，一跃成为宇宙各交战国争相笼络的当红人物。当然，他还有一个潜藏在心底的秘密。。。那就是用无数战争垃圾改造而成，只属于自己的宇宙第一巨舰。", "base": "files/article/html/36/36945", "chapters": [{"title": "作品相关", "volume": true}, {"title": "背景", "file": "2877314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天人族历史", "file": "2877315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "种族介绍", "file": "2877316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "清洗者历史", "file": "2877317.html", "available": false}, {"title": "人类共同历史", "file": "2877318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "《末世猎杀者》", "file": "2877319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "新人类历史", "file": "2877320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "《末世猎杀者》2", "file": "2877321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节 争食", "file": "2877323.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五节 贷款", "file": "2877324.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二节 头骨", "file": "2877325.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第六节 诡杀", "file": "2877326.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三节 格杀", "file": "2877327.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第七节 身份", "file": "2877328.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四节 等级", "file": "2877329.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第八节 星球", "file": "2877330.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第九节 黑市", "file": "2877331.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十节 训练", "file": "2896507.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十一节 精神", "file": "2896508.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十二节 酒吧", "file": "2896509.html", "available": true}]}